"A US maintenance company compares USD 1,200/month for two teams with USD 700 for one. Finance requires a like-for-like annual scope comparison and operations is satisfied with the incumbent. Funding timing is unconfirmed.",
"An Indian training provider compares INR 30,000/month for two cohorts with INR 18,000 for one. The accounts team needs tax and billing clarification, and the academic lead cannot approve a change before the current programme ends.",
"Prepare respostas para preço, orçamento, tempo, fornecedor e prioridade; em cada uma, escreva pergunta discriminante, evidência necessária e condição de encerramento.",
